OL,3,CHigh court clears way for clinical
OL,4,Ctrial on puberty blockers for children
OL,6,FA clinical trial into the benefits and
OL,7,Frisks of puberty blockers in teenagers
OL,8,Fis set to proceed after a legal
OL,9,Fchallenge over the trial was thrown
OL,10,Fout by a High Court judge.
OL,12,FThe trial, known as Pathways, is set
OL,13,Fto see around 220 children with
OL,14,Fpersistent gender incongruence receive
OL,15,Fpuberty-suppressing hormones, half of
OL,16,Fwhom would begin the treatment
OL,17,Fstraight away while half would start
OL,18,Fit a year later.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
