PN,31602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785590298
OL,3,CHigh court clears way for clinical
OL,4,Ctrial on puberty blockers for children
OL,6,FIt follows a review published in April
OL,7,F2024 by Baroness Cass, who found that
OL,8,Fthere was not enough evidence on the
OL,9,Fuse of puberty blockers for clinicians
OL,10,Fand families to make informed
OL,11,Fdecisions.
OL,13,FA campaign group and two individuals
OL,14,Fsought to bring legal action against
OL,15,Fthe Health Research Authority (HRA)
OL,16,Fand the Department of Health and
OL,17,FSocial Care over the proposed trial,
OL,18,Fbut this was dismissed by a judge on
OL,19,FFriday.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785590298
OL,3,CHigh court clears way for clinical
OL,4,Ctrial on puberty blockers for children
OL,6,FThe claimants in the legal action were
OL,7,FBayswater Support Group ` made up of
OL,8,Fparents and guardians of children and
OL,9,Fyoung adults who identify as trans or
OL,10,Fnon-binary.
OL,12,FThey were joined by psychotherapist
OL,13,FJames Esses and Keira Bell, who began
OL,14,Ftaking puberty blockers when she was
OL,15,F16 before later "detransitioning" and
OL,16,Fwho has spoken of the long-term
OL,17,Feffects such treatments had on her.
OL,26,@wD@QOUwD@aO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
