FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785590298
OL,3,CHigh court clears way for clinical
OL,4,Ctrial on puberty blockers for children
OL,6,FTheir lawyers told a hearing in London
OL,7,Fearlier this week that the group had
OL,8,Fconcerns about the long-term physical
OL,9,Fand mental side effects on children
OL,10,Fparticipating in the trial, claiming
OL,11,Fthat proper safeguards were not put in
OL,12,Fplace and that the ethical approval
OL,13,Fprocess was flawed.
OL,15,FThey asked a judge to allow the legal
OL,16,Fchallenge to proceed, and to make an
OL,17,Finjunction delaying the start of the
OL,18,Ftrial until the claim was determined.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
