PN,31605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785590298
OL,3,CHigh court clears way for clinical
OL,4,Ctrial on puberty blockers for children
OL,6,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FThe HRA and the government opposed the
OL,12,Fbid to continue the legal action.
OL,14,FIn a ruling on Friday, Mr Justice
OL,15,FChamberlain threw out the claim.
OL,17,FReading a summary of his judgment, he
OL,18,Fsaid: "The trial was commissioned by
OL,19,FNHS England and designed by its co-
OL,20,Fsponsors with conspicuous care, in
OL,21,Fconsultation with other expert bodies."
OL,26,@zD@GOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785590298
OL,3,CHigh court clears way for clinical
OL,4,Ctrial on puberty blockers for children
OL,6,FThe judge continued that none of the
OL,7,Fgrounds of challenge was "arguable
OL,8,Fwith a realistic prospect of success",
OL,9,Fand that the decision to approve the
OL,10,F"pragmatic" trial was
OL,11,F"quintessentially a question of
OL,12,Fjudgment" for public health bodies.
OL,14,FA spokesperson for the campaigners
OL,15,Fsaid following the ruling that they
OL,16,Fdisagreed "fundamentally" with the
OL,17,Fcourt's conclusions and were
OL,18,F"carefully considering" whether to
OL,19,Fseek an appeal.
