PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785590298
OL,3,CHigh court clears way for clinical
OL,4,Ctrial on puberty blockers for children
OL,6,FThey said: "The claimants continue to
OL,7,Fbelieve that important questions
OL,8,Fremain unanswered, including the
OL,9,Fextent to which regulators must ensure
OL,10,Fthat children enrolled in clinical
OL,11,Ftrials of risky experimental
OL,12,Ftreatments are likely to derive direct
OL,13,Fbenefit from participation, and
OL,14,Fwhether the regulatory framework
OL,15,Fgoverning research involving minors
OL,16,Fhas been interpreted consistently with
OL,17,Fthe protections it was designed to
OL,18,Fprovide."
OL,26,@nD@LOUzD@IO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/8
