OL,3,CHigh court clears way for clinical
OL,4,Ctrial on puberty blockers for children
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the Pathways
OL,7,Fresearch team welcomed the ruling,
OL,8,Fadding that the safety and welfare of
OL,9,Fparticipants "will remain our highest
OL,10,Fpriority".
